{"request_id": "6114:9", "dialogue_id": 6114, "turn": 9, "text": "好的，那就都退了吧，麻烦帮我处理一下。", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "c7b56d504b1f9bc57c914f647e0ecadc735d5a29063a86b1aa784e3fd0ed4df2"}
{"request_id": "4970:1", "dialogue_id": 4970, "turn": 1, "text": "我收到货了，但是里面没有遥控器和说明书，这怎么办啊？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "ae5db50b0529549839f4f7a66d3ca3fa21e5b56ec12a4f9c811f890ad602cdb4"}
{"request_id": "4970:3", "dialogue_id": 4970, "turn": 3, "text": "那现在少的东西怎么补给我呀\n大概多久能寄过来呢", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "a729f62b3e43b8e102b001f1f78592607091735e85cede329e069f1579cceb6b"}
