{"request_id": "4970:4", "dialogue_id": 4970, "turn": 4, "text": "好的，麻烦升级处理吧  \n那大概多久能有回复呢？", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "8128e21880432acde3ab383f1653a5a4488271b88a820809dca51d0dc6070c57"}
{"request_id": "4970:5", "dialogue_id": 4970, "turn": 5, "text": "好的，那专员大概多久联系我呀  \n我需要准备什么资料吗", "status": "ok", "prompt_sha256": "152ff9db7f655c165984d5a206ac24663f6e322ff61421122f11676c68dad299"}
